     deploy.sh g1zenoh mode generates this at $HOME/cyclonedds_spark.xml.
     Spark-local DDS lives on loopback; the bridge feeds the robot's topics here.
     Requires: sudo ip link set lo multicast on
               sudo ip route add 239.255.0.0/16 dev lo -->
